{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3435","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3435","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3435\",\"parent_revision\":\"45ce106772dc5dd88e95393d6f8d44b6c1098c37459971f97d63efbbe5bd315b\",\"root_revision\":\"45ce106772dc5dd88e95393d6f8d44b6c1098c37459971f97d63efbbe5bd315b\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-06\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nA repo-wide scan indexed 321 real skills and commands across 57 namespaces, then checked all 4,838 references in git-tracked files (354 Skill() calls, 1,387 namespaced, 3,097 bare). Seven references in agent-facing files name skills absent from disk. Two of the seven are being fixed separately as urgent; the remaining five are tracked here.\\n\\nBROKEN REFERENCES\\n\\n- plugin-creator:refactor, cited 4 times in plugins/plugin-creator/skills/refactor-plugin/SKILL.md lines 38, 39, 109, 112. The namespace actually provides refactor-plugin, refactor-skill, implement-refactor and start-refactor-task.\\n- plugin-creator:count-lines, cited in the same file at line 103. No such skill.\\n- perl-development:perl-standards, cited in dh-meta-docs/references/language-manifest-schema.md line 281. The namespace provides perl-development, perl-lint, perl-testing, perl-validate, perl-cpan-ecosystem and perl-environment-setup.\\n- typescript-development:add-new-feature, cited in work-backlog-item/references/workflows/work/feature-request.md line 54. There is no typescript-development plugin in the marketplace.\\n- Skill(skill: \\\"git-commit-helper\\\"), cited in .claude/skills/README.md line 339. No such skill.\\n\\nIMPACT\\n\\nEach reference tells an agent to activate something that cannot be activated. The failure surfaces at dispatch time as a missing skill rather than as a routing correction, so the agent loses the guidance the reference was meant to supply and continues without it.\\n\\nScope note: the audit deliberately separated file roles. References inside research/ and docs/ describe third-party tools and a non-resolving name there is expected, not a defect. Only agent-facing files are counted above.\\n\\nThree further references (astral:ty, astral:uv, hallucination-detector:hallucination-audit) are declared in marketplace.json with remote sources and are therefore not on disk in this checkout. They are recorded as unverifiable rather than broken and are out of scope here.\\n\\nUser-provided context: a re-runnable scanner was produced during the audit. Verifying each name against the namespace listing above will show whether the intended target was renamed or never existed, which changes whether the fix is a rename or a removal.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Repo-wide skill reference audit, 2026-09-06\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-06\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"36b366721711a40f1ca8f1a76263bc1c92b1bbe7a115f30dca052778874f3414\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABTSAjWg\"}"}